# Adobe Artifactory (npm) — supplemental notes
#
# Root `.npmrc` in this repo sets `@pim:registry` (no token) so scoped packages
# use the approved Artifactory virtual without repeating `publishConfig` per package.
# The unscoped CLI (`ado-pim`) keeps `publishConfig.registry` in packages/cli/package.json.
#
# Add auth in your user ~/.npmrc or CI (never commit tokens). Example:
# //artifactory-uw2.adobeitc.com/artifactory/api/npm/npmjs/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
# always-auth=true
#
# Corp registry alternatives (VPN / corporate network only) — replace the line in root `.npmrc` if needed:
# @pim:registry=https://artifactory.corp.adobe.com/artifactory/api/npm/npmjs/
# @pim:registry=https://artifactory-no1.corp.adobe.com/artifactory/api/npm/npmjs/
